              how pages will be mapped, constructed, or faulted in the future.

              MMAADDVV__CCOOLLLLAAPPSSEE  supports  private  anonymous pages (see mmmmaapp(2)),
              shmem pages, and file‐backed pages.  See MMAADDVV__HHUUGGEEPPAAGGEE for  gen‐
